WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.824
Step 1. Open the Medicine Administration sub-tab. Each row is one medicine.

2.1
00:00:06.824 --> 00:00:13.045
Step 2. Find the medicine. Enter its name in the Search Medication box.

3.1
00:00:13.045 --> 00:00:20.125
Step 3. Open the administration dialog. In the current time slot, select Administer.

4.1
00:00:20.125 --> 00:00:27.037
Step 4. Check the entry and the dosage. Care selects the latest active entry.

5.1
00:00:27.037 --> 00:00:32.734
Step 5. Set the status. Care sets Status to Completed.

6.1
00:00:32.734 --> 00:00:39.450
Step 6. Record the time. Care sets both times to the current date and time.

7.1
00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:46.647
Step 7. Add a note. To record more detail, enter text in Administration Notes.

8.1
00:00:46.647 --> 00:00:50.938
Step 8. Save the dose. Select Administer Medicine.

8.2
00:00:50.938 --> 00:00:54.428
Care shows the dose in its time slot.
